f-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Dewey County has come in under 90% of normal in November to December in 40 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 on the middle, August to September ran 170% of normal and November to December ran 30%. So far in 2026, April to May came in at 35% on the middle. Grid 19326 had its driest year in 1956 at 44%.</p>"}
